*[[1598]] - [[Henry IV of France]] issues the [[Edict of Nantes]], allowing [[freedom of religion]] to the [[Huguenot]]s
*[[1742]] - The world premiere of George Frideric Handel's oratorio Messiah in Dublin, Ireland.
