* [http://www.mrchausfastfood.com Mr. Chau's Chinese Fast Food] &amp;mdash; Locations in the [[San Francisco Bay Area]] and [[Silicon Valley]].
* [[Panda Express]] &amp;mdash; Nationwide in the USA.
